import{_ as t,o as i,c as o,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const h=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 608 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Predatory Faction Generic | Time-as-Resource Zero-Sum Game","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 608 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Predatory Faction Generic | Time-as-Resource Zero-Sum Game","no":608,"module":3,"tags":["Dual-Track Time Domain","Predatory Faction","Zero-Sum Game","Time Resource","Cross-Heavens Benchmark"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Thesis","01-Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto","15-Energy Cycle and Transformation Law"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0608_模块3-双轨时间域vs掠夺派通用-时间零和博弈.md","filePath":"en/0608_模块3-双轨时间域vs掠夺派通用-时间零和博弈.md"}'),a={name:"en/0608_模块3-双轨时间域vs掠夺派通用-时间零和博弈.md"};function r(s,e,l,u,m,c){return i(),o("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-608-dual-track-time-domain-vs-predatory-faction-generic-time-as-resource-zero-sum-game" tabindex="-1">Entry 608 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Predatory Faction Generic | Time-as-Resource Zero-Sum Game <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-608-dual-track-time-domain-vs-predatory-faction-generic-time-as-resource-zero-sum-game" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 608 | Dual-Track Time Domain vs Predatory Faction Generic | Time-as-Resource Zero-Sum Game&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain | Benchmark base: Documents 04, 01, 15 | Series: Cross-Heavens Time-View Benchmark (Entry 8 · Conclusion)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-when-time-is-treated-as-the-last-remaining-stock-to-grab" tabindex="-1">Introduction: when time is treated as the last remaining stock to grab <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-when-time-is-treated-as-the-last-remaining-stock-to-grab" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: when time is treated as the last remaining stock to grab&quot;">​</a></h2><p>From Tang Luo to Shrouding the Heavens, from Perfect World to Douluo, from Dragon Ball to Manghuangji, to Infinite Terror, the preceding seven benchmarks point to the same underlying assumption — <strong>in predatory-faction worlds, time itself is a zero-sum stock</strong>: your fast is my slow; your opportunity is my loss; the extra hundred years you live is the hundred years I was squeezed off the time track. This entry, as the cross-heavens time-view benchmark series&#39; conclusion, fully lays out this underlying assumption, and argues how the dual-track time domain fundamentally abolishes &quot;time zero-sum.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms are this conclusion&#39;s overall criterion: anti-predation axiom directly targets &quot;develop increment, do not consume stock&quot;; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires evolution qualifications not be mutually exclusive; collective ascension axiom requires time investment be made positive-sum; causal self-discipline axiom requires time scheduling not create zero-sum causality; law-first axiom requires &quot;whether time is finite&quot; first argued by law, not default by zero-sum intuition. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-predatory-faction-s-time-zero-sum-axiom" tabindex="-1">I. The Predatory Faction&#39;s Time Zero-Sum Axiom <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-predatory-faction-s-time-zero-sum-axiom" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Predatory Faction&#39;s Time Zero-Sum Axiom&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predatory-faction worldviews share an unspoken axiom: <strong>total time fixed, the more strong ones, the less each gets</strong>. From this, a whole set of &quot;reasonable&quot; behaviors follows:</p><ol><li><strong>Grab time = get strong</strong>: seize others&#39; lifespans, swallow others&#39; opportunities, occupy others&#39; blessed grounds, equals directly seizing the other&#39;s time.</li><li><strong>Elimination = purification</strong>: losers&#39; time voided is seen as &quot;heavenly Dao&#39;s choice,&quot; the price of evolution.</li><li><strong>Monopoly = justice</strong>: whoever is strong occupies, natural; the weak being slow is deserved.</li></ol><p>Once this axiom stands, all cruelty is rationalized. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s work is to prove this axiom <strong>wrong</strong>.</p><h2 id="ii-why-zero-sum-is-wrong-time-may-be-grown" tabindex="-1">II. Why Zero-Sum Is Wrong: Time May Be &quot;Grown&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-zero-sum-is-wrong-time-may-be-grown" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why Zero-Sum Is Wrong: Time May Be &quot;Grown&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Anti-predation axiom&#39;s (Document 04) core is: <strong>develop increment, do not consume stock</strong>. Time in the dual-track system is precisely the resource that best embodies this:</p><ul><li><strong>Efficiency may be multiplied</strong>: the Origin Acceleration Domain relies on 100× deduction amplification (Document 16), amplifying the same wall-clock time&#39;s output a hundredfold — no more time spent, but &quot;effective time&quot; grown. This is increment, not zero-sum.</li><li><strong>Outputs may be shared</strong>: techniques and technologies practiced in the acceleration domain enter the Alaya Network network-wide open; one person practices = Myriad Ranks benefit. Knowledge&#39;s copy cost is zero, naturally positive-sum.</li><li><strong>Depth irreplaceable but feedback-able</strong>: Quest Sediment Domain trials are personal experience, non-transferable, but their lessons may be abstracted into knowledge feedback — detours you walked, later-comers need not re-walk.</li></ul><p>Conclusion: <strong>time is not a cake, cut one piece, one less; time is more like fire, lighting one illuminates the whole room</strong>. The predatory faction mistakenly treats time as stock; the symbiotic faction treats time as increment — this is the two factions&#39; fundamental divergence at the time dimension.</p><h2 id="iii-civilizational-consequences-of-zero-sum-game" tabindex="-1">III. Civilizational Consequences of Zero-Sum Game <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-civilizational-consequences-of-zero-sum-game" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Civilizational Consequences of Zero-Sum Game&quot;">​</a></h2><p>As long as &quot;time zero-sum&quot; holds, civilization necessarily walks three dead ends:</p><ol><li><strong>Class solidification</strong>: first-time occupiers permanently lead; later-comers never get a chance — conflicts with Myriad-Rank Republican axiom.</li><li><strong>Knowledge gap between generations</strong>: time and opportunities buried with the strong; civilization repeatedly starts from zero — conflicts with collective-ascension axiom.</li><li><strong>Strong-one loneliness</strong>: to guard grabbed time, the strong must be wary of everyone, ultimately alone-deciding eternity or lone-path seclusion — conflicts with experience-sense preservation.</li></ol><p>These three are precisely the lesions the preceding seven entries saw in Tang Luo, Shrouding the Heavens, Perfect World, etc. Zero-sum is not some work&#39;s bug, but the predatory-faction worldview&#39;s underlying virus.</p><h2 id="iv-how-the-dual-track-fundamentally-abolishes-zero-sum" tabindex="-1">IV. How the Dual Track Fundamentally Abolishes Zero-Sum <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-how-the-dual-track-fundamentally-abolishes-zero-sum" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. How the Dual Track Fundamentally Abolishes Zero-Sum&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The dual-track time domain&#39;s institutional design everywhere is &quot;anti-zero-sum&quot;:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Zero-Sum Predation Logic</th><th>Dual-Track Symbiosis Logic</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Grab others&#39; time for own use</td><td>Efficiency increment grows total time (Origin Acceleration Domain)</td></tr><tr><td>Failure = time voided</td><td>Joint contracting, everyone has a baseline not zeroed</td></tr><tr><td>Opportunities monopolized</td><td>Alaya Network coordinates, scheduled by contribution</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge leaves with the person</td><td>Knowledge network-wide fed back, later-comers stand on predecessors&#39; shoulders</td></tr><tr><td>Strong ones guard time in loneliness</td><td>Myriad Ranks share time dividends, collective ascension</td></tr></tbody></table><p>In one sentence: <strong>the dual track is not &quot;more fairly dividing that fixed cake,&quot; but &quot;growing the cake, and proving it can be infinitely grown&quot;</strong>.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: zero-sum games waste massive time on mutual contention and elimination voiding; the dual track turns this time into incremental R&amp;D</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: fundamentally denies &quot;grab time = get strong,&quot; directs time use toward incremental development rather than stock plunder</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system is precisely &quot;time zero-sum&quot; typical — inclusion stops at the walls; the dual track proves time may be positive-sum, inclusion may be boundless</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: after time increment grows, 99% of Myriad Ranks benefit, no need to evolve by eliminating own kind</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the positive-sum time model may infinitely expand; any newly merged plane may接入 incremental time economy, not be dragged into zero-sum jungle</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The deepest fear in predatory-faction worlds is &quot;time not enough to go around.&quot; So they grab, they kill, they squeeze their own kind off the track. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s dual-track time domain answers this fear with engineering: time is enough to go around — not by alms, but by efficiency growing it. When &quot;your fast no longer equals my slow,&quot; predation&#39;s underlying logic collapses by half. This is why Module Three spends a full 33 entries on time: <strong>whoever controls time&#39;s allocation method controls civilization&#39;s master switch of symbiosis or plunder.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">Entry 04 · Anti-Predation Core Thesis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/01-锚点共生文明宣言.html">Entry 01 · Anchor Symbiotic Civilization Manifesto</a> · <a href="./501_模块3-双轨时间域总论.html">Entry 501 · Dual-Track Time Domain Overview</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const g=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{h as __pageData,g as default};
